#: src/sys_shortcuts.py:151
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts mismatch detected for Xfce Start Menu."
msgstr ""
"Der blev registreret uoverensstemmelse i tastaturgenveje for Xfce Start Menu."

#: src/sys_shortcuts.py:156
msgid ""
"Fix incompatible shortcuts now?\n"
"If left as is, system menu hotkeys may work unstably.\n"
"You can also review them manually in: Settings → Keyboard → Application "
"Shortcuts.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Vil du rette inkompatible genveje nu?\n"
"Hvis de forbliver uændrede, kan systemmenuens genvejstaster fungere "
"ustabilt.\n"
"Du kan også gennemgå dem manuelt under: Indstillinger → Tastatur → "
"Programgenveje.\n"
"\n"

